From 2fbe362baedd36874573bdd65fd6afd6e5cf514d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 15:56:30 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(sim): law (d)'s prior readers read the stock through
 Columns

verify::prior_surface and verify::acquit_by_prior took &Dexel; they now
take &Columns, the M7.3 column seam a column or field Stock already
answers through. Columns gains of_grid (a bare rest grid, borrowed) and
cell/center/origin; the operation layer wraps its program-ahead grid
until #586 moves that holder onto Stock. Behaviour-neutral: the four
verify::prior unit tests pass unchanged; the new prior_columns suite
shows a column stock, a field stock and a bare grid read the same prior
surface and acquit the same dives.

Fixes #585
Refs #26

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
